Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "First copy", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-24T14:44:07Z", "username": "Meghna", "text": "Hermes?!!!", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": true, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-24T14:44:07Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "types of purses", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-24T14:44:20Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "oh very nice", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-24T14:44:28Z", "username": "Meghna", "text": "Birkin pe atak gaya tha dimaag", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-24T14:44:33Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "These are all the names of Hermes handbags, and my last q would have been on Jane Birkin", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-24T14:44:57Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "they have a bag called Horse’s Feedbag. and people buy it?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-24T14:45:07Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "The Geta - Introduced in 2021, the Hermès bag style Geta is inspired by and named for traditional Japanese platform sandals. The Hermès bag named 24/24 was launched in 2018 and was named to convey that it can be effortlessly worn around the clock. While most Hermès bag names are female-inspired, the Picotin is purely equestrian inspired. Picotin is the French term for a unit of horse feed and bag resembles a horse’s feed bag", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-24T14:45:34Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "The Hermès Bolide bag was designed by Emile Hermès as a gift for his wife. Originally called “le sac pour l’auto,“ the bag’s name was changed to Bolide, which translates to “comet”", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-24T14:45:44Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "ok if you put the name in French, then it’s all haute couture", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-24T14:45:54Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Designed by Frédéric Vidal, the Lindy Hop bag was created as a homage to the American Street Dance, Lindy Hop.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-24T14:46:01Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Lovely connect. Actually lot of fashion and clothing inspiration comes from horse riding and horses if you think about it", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-24T14:46:33Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "The Hermès Kelly bag name was originally the Sac à Dépêches, or the Dispatch bag. In 1954, the costume designer for the Alfred Hitchcock film To Catch a Thief chose the bag for Grace Kelly’s character to carry. The legendary actress fell in love with the bag and kept it after the film’s release. Grace Kelly, then Princess Grace of Monaco, was later photographed carrying her bag to hide her baby bump. The photo made the cover of Life magazine. Fashionable women worldwide soon clamored for the “Kelly bag.”", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-24T14:46:40Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "And equestian", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-24T14:47:18Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Hermes’ logo is a huge horse cart or buggy", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-24T14:47:23Z", "username": "Meghna", "text": "Ye kviz mein tha i remember", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]